WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Vheani bodelo ḽa kale ḽa plastiki tsini na tshimela.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Remani ni bvise fhasi ha bodelo. Vhulungani tshivhalo.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Itani mabuli maṱuku kha tshivhalo, ni dovhe ni tshi vale.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Vhulungani bodelo mulomo wo sedza fhasi. Magumo o vuleaho a sale nṱha zwiṱuku ha mavu.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Ḓadzani bodelo nga nṱha. Maḓi a rotha nga zwiṱuku nga tshivhalo tshi re mavuni.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Musi maḓi a tshi fhungudzea kha bodelo, a phaḓalala mavuni u mona na midzi.
